const sectionNames={shop:'الألعاب والباقات',wallet:'المحفظة والنقاط',track:'تتبع الطلب',support:'التواصل مع الدعم',order:'إنشاء طلب شحن',chatapps:'تطبيقات الدردشة',transfer:'تحويل الرصيد'};const sectionTargets={home:null,shop:'shop',wallet:'wallet',track:'track',support:'support',order:'order',chatapps:'chatapps',transfer:'transfer',topup:'wallet',games:'shop'};
function safeSectionUrl(v){const u=String(v||'').trim();return /^(https?:\/\/|\/|#)/i.test(u)?u:''}
function loadDynamicSections(rows){document.querySelectorAll('[data-custom-section],.custom-section-card').forEach(x=>x.remove());const grid=document.querySelector('.quick-sections-grid');const back=document.querySelector('#sectionBack');if(!grid||!back)return;(rows||[]).forEach(x=>{const key='custom-'+x.slug;sectionNames[key]=x.title;sectionTargets[key]=key;const href='#'+key;const btn=safeSectionUrl(x.button_url);grid.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<a class="quick-section-card custom-section-card" data-custom-section href="${href}"><span class="quick-icon">${esc(x.icon||'✦')}</span><strong>${esc(x.title)}</strong><small>${esc(x.description||'')}</small><b>دخول القسم ←</b></a>`);back.insertAdjacentHTML('afterend',`<section class="section custom-section" data-main-section="${key}" data-custom-section><div class="container"><div class="section-title"><div><label>قسم مستقل</label><h2>${esc(x.icon||'✦')} ${esc(x.title)}</h2></div><p>${esc(x.description||'')}</p></div><div class="panel custom-section-panel"><div class="custom-content">${esc(x.content||'')}</div>${btn&&x.button_text?`<a class="btn" href="${esc(btn)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(x.button_text)} ←</a>`:''}</div></div></section>`)});}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const a=e.target.closest?.('a[href="#order"]');if(!a)return;e.preventDefault();const g=a.dataset.game;const game=document.getElementById('gameId');if(g&&game){game.value=g;game.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));}openMainSection('order',true);requestAnimationFrame(()=>{const order=document.getElementById('order');if(order&&!order.classList.contains('section-hidden'))order.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});});},{capture:true});window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{const h=location.hash.slice(1),t=sectionTargets[h];openMainSection(t||null,false,t&&h!==t?h:'')});
function openMainSection(name,writeHash=true,subId=''){const inside=!!sectionNames[name];document.body.classList.toggle('inside-section',inside);document.querySelectorAll('[data-main-section]').forEach(x=>{const show=inside&&x.dataset.mainSection===name;x.classList.toggle('section-hidden',!show);x.style.display=show?'block':'none'});const home=$('#sectionHome');if(home){home.classList.toggle('section-hidden',inside);home.style.display=inside?'none':'block'}const back=$('#sectionBack');if(back){back.classList.toggle('hidden',!inside);back.style.display=inside?'flex':'none'}if($('#sectionHeading'))$('#sectionHeading').textContent=inside?sectionNames[name]:'';if(writeHash){history.pushState({},'',inside?'#'+name:location.pathname+location.search)}if(inside){window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});if(name==='track'){startTrackAutoRefresh();if(!trackLoading)setTimeout(()=>loadTrackOrders(),0)}if(subId)setTimeout(()=>document.getElementById(subId)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'}),120)}else{stopTrackAutoRefresh();window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}}


let toastTimer;function flashMessage(text,type='error',duration=2000){const el=$('#siteToast');if(!el)return;el.textContent=text;el.className=`site-toast ${type}`;clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>el.classList.add('hidden'),duration)}window.flashMessage=flashMessage;window.waitForBaseCardMessagePaint=()=>new Promise(resolve=>{if(typeof requestAnimationFrame==='function')requestAnimationFrame(()=>requestAnimationFrame(resolve));else setTimeout(resolve,80)})
function show(id,text,type=''){const el=$(id);if(!el)return;el.textContent=text;el.className=`alert ${type}`;el.classList.remove('hidden');}
function esc(v){return String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));}
const requiredFields={game_id:'اختر اللعبة أولًا',package_id:'اختر الباقة أولًا',player_id:'اكتب Player ID أولًا' };
Object.entries(requiredFields).forEach(([n,m])=>{const el=document.querySelector(`[name="${n}"]`);if(el){el.addEventListener('invalid',()=>el.setCustomValidity(m));el.addEventListener('input',()=>el.setCustomValidity(''));el.addEventListener('change',()=>el.setCustomValidity(''))}});
function money(n,c){return c==='SYP'?`${Number(n||0).toLocaleString('ar-SY')} ل.س`:`${Number(n||0).toFixed(2)} $`}
function parseFlexibleAmount(value){let s=String(value??'').trim().replace(/[٠-٩]/g,d=>String('٠١٢٣٤٥٦٧٨٩'.indexOf(d))).replace(/[۰-۹]/g,d=>String('۰۱۲۳۴۵۶۷۸۹'.indexOf(d))).replace(/[٬\s]/g,'').replace(/٫/g,'.');const comma=s.lastIndexOf(','),dot=s.lastIndexOf('.');if(comma>=0&&dot>=0){if(comma>dot)s=s.replace(/\./g,'').replace(/,/g,'.');else s=s.replace(/,/g,'')}else if(comma>=0){if(/^\d{1,3}(,\d{3})+$/.test(s))s=s.replace(/,/g,'');else if((s.match(/,/g)||[]).length===1)s=s.replace(',','.');else return NaN}else if((s.match(/\./g)||[]).length>1){if(/^\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{3})+$/.test(s))s=s.replace(/\./g,'');else return NaN}if(!/^(?:\d+(?:\.\d+)?|\.\d+)$/.test(s))return NaN;return Number(s)}

function updateUsdConversionRateNote(value){const rate=Number(value);currentUsdToSypRate=Number.isFinite(rate)&&rate>0?rate:null;const text=currentUsdToSypRate?currentUsdToSypRate.toLocaleString('ar-SY',{maximumFractionDigits:2}):'سعر الصرف المعتمد';const el=$('#usdConversionRateText');if(el)el.textContent=text;const orderNote=$('#orderExchangeRateNote');if(orderNote)orderNote.textContent=currentUsdToSypRate?`سعر الصرف الحالي: 1 دولار = ${text} ل.س جديدة. المبالغ بالدولار تُحوَّل بهذا السعر؛ أسعار الباقات المعروضة بالليرة تبقى كما هي.`:'يتعذر عرض سعر الصرف حاليًا؛ سيُستخدم السعر المحفوظ عند مراجعة طلب الدولار.';updateUsdTopupPreview()}
async function refreshUsdConversionRateNote(){const r=await sb.from('settings').select('value').eq('key','usd_to_syp_rate').maybeSingle();if(!r.error)updateUsdConversionRateNote(r.data?.value)}
window.addEventListener('focus',refreshUsdConversionRateNote);
let currentUsdToSypRate=null;
function updateUsdTopupPreview(){const box=$('#usdTopupPreview'),form=$('#topupForm');if(!box||!form)return;const currency=form.querySelector('[name="currency"]')?.value||'USD',raw=form.querySelector('[name="amount"]')?.value||'',amount=parseFlexibleAmount(raw);if(currency!=='USD'){box.textContent='يُضاف المبلغ بالليرة السورية كما أُدخل، دون تحويل.';return}if(!currentUsdToSypRate){box.textContent='سيظهر المبلغ المكافئ بالليرة عند توفر سعر الصرف.';return}if(!String(raw).trim()){box.textContent='أدخل المبلغ لعرض ما يعادله بالليرة السورية.';return}if(!Number.isFinite(amount)||amount<=0){box.textContent='أدخل مبلغًا صحيحًا بالدولار.';return}const converted=Math.round((amount*currentUsdToSypRate+Number.EPSILON)*100)/100,warning=amount<5?' الحد الأدنى للشحن 5 دولارات.':'';box.textContent=`يعادله ${converted.toLocaleString('ar-SY',{maximumFractionDigits:2})} ل.س جديدة.${warning}`}
$('#topupForm [name="amount"]')?.addEventListener('input',updateUsdTopupPreview);$('#topupForm [name="currency"]')?.addEventListener('change',updateUsdTopupPreview);
function whatsappNumber(v){let n=String(v||'').replace(/\D/g,'');if(n.startsWith('00'))n=n.slice(2);if(n.startsWith('0'))n='963'+n.slice(1);else if(!n.startsWith('963'))n='963'+n;return n}
async function loadConfig(){
 const [s,g,p]=await Promise.all([sb.from('settings').select('key,value'),sb.from('games').select('*').eq('visible',true).order('sort_order'),sb.from('packages').select('id,game_id,name,price,price_amount,currency,note,visible,sort_order,created_at').eq('visible',true).order('sort_order')]);
 let sec={data:[]}; try { sec=await sb.from('site_sections').select('*').eq('visible',true).order('sort_order').order('id'); } catch (_) {}
 if(s.error||g.error||p.error){
  // Keep the authenticated order form usable when a non-catalog table is temporarily unavailable.
  // KM product IDs/prices still come only from the verified provider/local catalog below.
  if(g.error||!(g.data||[]).length) g.data=[{id:9001,name:'Free Fire Global',description:'شحن الجواهر',icon:'🔥',visible:true},{id:9002,name:'PUBG Global',description:'شحن الشدات',icon:'🎯',visible:true}];
  if(p.error) p.data=[];
 }
 config={settings:Object.fromEntries((s.data||[]).map(x=>[x.key,x.value])),games:g.data||[],packages:p.data||[],sections:sec.data||[]};updateUsdConversionRateNote(config.settings.usd_to_syp_rate);window.__baseSettings=config.settings;window.dispatchEvent(new Event('base-settings-ready'));
 loadDynamicSections(config.sections);
 const x=config.settings;if($('#brandName'))$('#brandName').textContent=x.site_name||'Base Card';if($('#brandTagline'))$('#brandTagline').textContent=x.tagline||'';if($('#paymentInfo'))$('#paymentInfo').textContent=x.sham_cash||'اشحن رصيدك من قسم شراء النقاط أولًا.';if($('#walletPaymentInfo'))$('#walletPaymentInfo').textContent=x.sham_cash||'سيتم عرض بيانات شام كاش هنا بعد ضبطها من لوحة الإدارة.';
 if(x.sham_cash_qr&&$('#paymentQr')&&$('#qrBox')){$('#paymentQr').src=x.sham_cash_qr;$('#qrBox').classList.remove('hidden')}
 const wa=whatsappNumber(x.support_whatsapp);if(wa&&$('#whatsappLink')){$('#whatsappLink').href=`https://wa.me/${wa}`;$('#whatsappLink').target='_blank';if($('#whatsappNumber'))$('#whatsappNumber').textContent=x.support_whatsapp||''}
 renderGameSelection();
 await loadKmGameCatalog();
}
async function loadUser(){const {data}=await sb.auth.getUser();currentUser=data.user||null;let isAdmin=false;if(currentUser){const pr=await sb.from('profiles').select('role').eq('id',currentUser.id).maybeSingle();isAdmin=pr.data?.role==='admin'}document.querySelectorAll('.admin-link,a[href="./admin.html"]').forEach(x=>x.remove());if(isAdmin){const nav=document.querySelector('header nav');if(nav){const a=document.createElement('a');a.id='adminLink';a.className='btn btn-sm admin-link';a.href='./admin.html';a.textContent='لوحة الإدارة';nav.appendChild(a)}}if(currentUser){await syncPendingCustomerPushSubscription();$('#googleLogin').classList.add('hidden');$('#userMenu').classList.remove('hidden');$('#userName').textContent=`مرحبًا ${currentUser.user_metadata?.full_name||currentUser.email||'بك'}`;$('#walletGuest').classList.add('hidden');$('#walletPanel').classList.remove('hidden');await loadWallet();await loadCustomerPushStatus()}else{$('#googleLogin').classList.remove('hidden');$('#userMenu').classList.add('hidden');$('#walletGuest').classList.remove('hidden');$('#walletPanel').classList.add('hidden');renderTrackGuest()}}
let walletSnapshotAt=0,walletReadSequence=0;
function applyWalletSnapshot(snapshot){if(!snapshot||snapshot.balance_after===null||snapshot.balance_after===undefined)return;const n=Number(snapshot.balance_after);if(!Number.isFinite(n))return;const currency=snapshot.balance_currency||snapshot.currency||'SYP';if(currency==='SYP'&&$('#balanceSyp'))$('#balanceSyp').textContent=money(n,'SYP');if(currency==='USD'&&$('#balanceUsd'))$('#balanceUsd').textContent=money(n,'USD');walletSnapshotAt=Date.now()}
window.applyWalletSnapshot=applyWalletSnapshot;
async function loadWallet(force=false){
  if(!currentUser)return;
  const requestId=++walletReadSequence,userId=currentUser.id;
  try{
    const [w,t]=await Promise.all([sb.from('wallets').select('*').eq('user_id',userId).maybeSingle(),sb.from('wallet_transactions').select('*').eq('user_id',userId).order('created_at',{ascending:false}).limit(30)]);
    if(requestId!==walletReadSequence||currentUser?.id!==userId)return;
    if(!w.error){const wallet=w.data||{balance_usd:0,balance_syp:0};if(force||Date.now()-walletSnapshotAt>1800){if($('#balanceUsd'))$('#balanceUsd').textContent=money(wallet.balance_usd,'USD');if($('#balanceSyp'))$('#balanceSyp').textContent=money(wallet.balance_syp,'SYP')}}
    if(!t.error){const rows=t.data||[];$('#transactionsTable').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<div class="transaction-row"><span>${esc(labels[x.type]||x.type)}<small>${esc(String(x.description||'').replace(/KM\s*Card|كيم\s*كارد/ig,'خدمة الشحن'))}<br>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString('ar-SY',{timeZone:'Asia/Damascus'})}</small></span><b class="${Number(x.amount)>=0?'plus':'minus'}">${Number(x.amount)>=0?'+':''}${money(x.amount,x.currency||'SYP')}</b></div>`).join(''):'<div class="empty">لا توجد عمليات بعد.</div>'}
  }catch(_){}
}

